Fixed the `Table` header controls and the `MenuItem` focus ring. A `Column` that holds a control, like a menu button, no longer clips it to a 20px label, so the control keeps its hover background and focus ring and takes the keyboard focus itself. The drag column header doesn't clip its control either. `MenuItem` draws its focus ring inside, like the other collection items, so a sticky `MenuSection` title can't cover it. @sneridagh
